    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d253-a1">

                <pb facs="0240" n="234" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg234"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Herbert to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Navy Department</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-01-27"><hi rendition="#italic">January 27,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to submit, for your
                    information, the following translation of a cipher dispatch sent by this
                    Department to the commander in chief of the North Atlantic Station:</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">January</hi> 27, 1894.</p>
                    <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stanton</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Port au Prince:</hi></p>
                    <p>The United States consular agent reports Honduras invading at Cape Gracias á
                        Dios, Nicaragua. Go immediately with <hi rendition="#italic">Kearsarge</hi>
                        to protect lives and property of American citizens at or in neighborhood of
                        Bluefields, Nicaragua, and report condition of affairs. Subsequent movements
                        left to your discretion.</p>
                    <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Herbert.</hi></p>
                </quote>
                <p>Very respectfully, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. A. Herbert</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of the Navy.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
